{"id":39,"date":"2020-12-22T03:48:36","date_gmt":"2020-12-22T10:48:36","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/kiierr.com\/?page_id=39"},"modified":"2024-11-06T02:16:06","modified_gmt":"2024-11-06T09:16:06","slug":"how-it-works","status":"publish","type":"page","link":"https:\/\/kiierr.com\/how-it-works\/","title":{"rendered":"How It Works"},"content":{"rendered":"  <div id=\"page-header-1640906620\" class=\"page-header-wrapper\">\n  <div class=\"page-title dark featured-title\">\n\n    \n    <div class=\"page-title-inner container align-center flex-row medium-flex-wrap\" >\n              <div class=\"title-wrapper flex-col text-left medium-text-center\">\n          <h1 class=\"entry-title mb-0\">\n            How Kiierr Laser Caps Work          <\/h1>\n        <\/div>\n                    <div class=\"title-content flex-col flex-right text-right medium-text-center\">\n        <div class=\"title-breadcrumbs pb-half pt-half\"><nav class=\"woocommerce-breadcrumb breadcrumbs uppercase\">Home<\/nav><\/div>      <\/div>\n    <\/div>\n\n       <\/div>\n    <\/div>\n  \n\n\t<section class=\"section\" id=\"section_511786127\">\n\t\t<div class=\"section-bg fill\" >\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\n\t\t<\/div>\n\n\t\t\n\n\t\t<div class=\"section-content relative\">\n\t\t\t\n<div class=\"row\"  id=\"row-704227934\">\n\n\t<div id=\"col-1224055713\" class=\"col small-12 large-12\"  >\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"col-inner\"  >\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t<div id=\"text-3272650965\" class=\"text\">\n\t\t\n<h2>KIIERR LASER CAPS UTILIZE LOW-LEVEL LASER THERAPY (LLLT) TO SAFELY REGROW HAIR FOLLICLES<\/h2>\n\t\t\n<style>\n#text-3272650965 {\n  color: rgb(0,0,0);\n}\n#text-3272650965 > * {\n  color: rgb(0,0,0);\n}\n<\/style>\n\t<\/div>\n\t\n<div class=\"row\"  id=\"row-1390123083\">\n\n\t<div id=\"col-142426388\" class=\"col medium-8 small-12 large-8\"  >\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"col-inner\"  >\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t<div id=\"text-1851716268\" class=\"text\">\n\t\t\n<p>Low-level laser light therapy (LLLT) was discovered in the 1960s. Endre Mester, a Hungarian physician, started a series of experiments on mice while utilizing this technology. The mice were shaved and the experiments were intended to detect if the lasers caused cancer in animals. Mester\u2019s findings showed that laser therapy did not cause cancer. Instead, it produced new hair growth around the shaved areas of the mice. <\/p>\n<p>Low-level laser therapy (LLLT), is also known as cold laser therapy, photobiomodulation, low-intensity light therapy, and soft laser therapy. LLLT is a form of therapy that applies low-level lasers or light-emitting diodes (LEDs) to the surface of the body. Devices that utilize this powerful technology are known as laser caps, and are also referred to as cold lasers, because they don\u2019t actually produce heat. This means it is considered a non-invasive, pain-free, hair growth treatment option.<\/p>\n<p>The scientific concept for LLLT is that light emitted from the laser stimulates the growth of hair and reduces hair loss. It is claimed that the application of low-power lasers stimulates and enhances cell function. This process, called photobiomodulation, occurs when laser light is absorbed by cells and stimulates their metabolism and protein synthesis. Studies like this one have also confirmed that PW LLLT treatments have excellent pain-relieving &#038; wound healing properties, as well as the ability to improve the functioning of various cells.<\/p>\n\t\t\n<style>\n#text-1851716268 {\n  color: rgb(0,0,0);\n}\n#text-1851716268 > * {\n  color: rgb(0,0,0);\n}\n<\/style>\n\t<\/div>\n\t\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\n\t\n\n\t<div id=\"col-1176434790\" class=\"col medium-4 small-12 large-4\"  >\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"col-inner\"  >\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t<div class=\"img has-hover x md-x lg-x y md-y lg-y\" id=\"image_34667006\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"img-inner dark\" >\n\t\t\t<img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1422\" height=\"1991\" src=\"https:\/\/kiierr.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/01\/Kiierr-laser-ca-how-it-works-image.png\" class=\"attachment-original size-original\" alt=\"Kiierr laser ca- how it works image\" srcset=\"https:\/\/kiierr.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/01\/Kiierr-laser-ca-how-it-works-image.png 1422w, https:\/\/kiierr.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/01\/Kiierr-laser-ca-how-it-works-image-800x1120.png 800w, https:\/\/kiierr.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/01\/Kiierr-laser-ca-how-it-works-image-214x300.png 214w, https:\/\/kiierr.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/01\/Kiierr-laser-ca-how-it-works-image-731x1024.png 731w, https:\/\/kiierr.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/01\/Kiierr-laser-ca-how-it-works-image-768x1075.png 768w, https:\/\/kiierr.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/01\/Kiierr-laser-ca-how-it-works-image-1097x1536.png 1097w, https:\/\/kiierr.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/01\/Kiierr-laser-ca-how-it-works-image-1080x1512.png 1080w, https:\/\/kiierr.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/01\/Kiierr-laser-ca-how-it-works-image-1280x1792.png 1280w, https:\/\/kiierr.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/01\/Kiierr-laser-ca-how-it-works-image-980x1372.png 980w, https:\/\/kiierr.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/01\/Kiierr-laser-ca-how-it-works-image-480x672.png 480w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1422px) 100vw, 1422px\" \/>\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n<style>\n#image_34667006 {\n  width: 54%;\n}\n<\/style>\n\t<\/div>\n\t\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\n\t\n<\/div>\n<div class=\"row\"  id=\"row-1995999595\">\n\n\t<div id=\"col-1796276944\" class=\"col medium-8 small-12 large-8\"  >\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"col-inner\"  >\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t<div id=\"text-2533838268\" class=\"text\">\n\t\t\n<p>LLLT uses laser or light energy below a specific energy threshold and within a specific wavelength to stimulate skin tissue. Laser light therapy stimulates the re-entrance of the anagen phase of the hair growth cycle in hair follicles that are currently in the telogen phase.<\/p>\n<p>Our Kiierr laser caps has been calibrated to emit a 650 nm wavelength, which has been clinically proven to aid in the promotion of hair growth. One thing to note is that the results do not happen overnight and can take time, so it\u2019s important to be patient. We don\u2019t lose all of our hair overnight, so it\u2019s imperative that you use the device consistently and for the full seven months. It\u2019s not uncommon for some users to observe regrowth after only a couple months of use.<\/p>\n\t\t\n<style>\n#text-2533838268 {\n  color: rgb(0,0,0);\n}\n#text-2533838268 > * {\n  color: rgb(0,0,0);\n}\n<\/style>\n\t<\/div>\n\t\n<a href=\"\/product\/kiierr-laser-hair-growth-products\/\" class=\"button primary\"  style=\"border-radius:99px;\">\n\t\t<span>View Products<\/span>\n\t<\/a>\n\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\n\t\n\n\t<div id=\"col-1295553762\" class=\"col medium-4 small-12 large-4\"  >\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"col-inner\"  >\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t<div class=\"img has-hover x md-x lg-x y md-y lg-y\" id=\"image_1639380337\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"img-inner dark\" >\n\t\t\t<img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"400\" src=\"https:\/\/kiierr.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/03\/Ideal-Wavelength-For-Safe-Effective-Laser-Hair-Regrowth.png\" class=\"attachment-original size-original\" alt=\"ideal wavelength for safe effective laser hair regrowth\" srcset=\"https:\/\/kiierr.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/03\/Ideal-Wavelength-For-Safe-Effective-Laser-Hair-Regrowth.png 600w, https:\/\/kiierr.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/03\/Ideal-Wavelength-For-Safe-Effective-Laser-Hair-Regrowth-247x165.png 247w, https:\/\/kiierr.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/03\/Ideal-Wavelength-For-Safe-Effective-Laser-Hair-Regrowth-510x340.png 510w, https:\/\/kiierr.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/03\/Ideal-Wavelength-For-Safe-Effective-Laser-Hair-Regrowth-300x200.png 300w, https:\/\/kiierr.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/03\/Ideal-Wavelength-For-Safe-Effective-Laser-Hair-Regrowth-595xh.png 595w, https:\/\/kiierr.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/03\/Ideal-Wavelength-For-Safe-Effective-Laser-Hair-Regrowth-480x320.png 480w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 600px) 100vw, 600px\" \/>\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n<style>\n#image_1639380337 {\n  width: 86%;\n}\n<\/style>\n\t<\/div>\n\t\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\n\t\n<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\n\t\n<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\n\t\t\n<style>\n#section_511786127 {\n  padding-top: 30px;\n  padding-bottom: 30px;\n}\n<\/style>\n\t<\/section>\n\t\n\n\t<section class=\"section\" id=\"section_667410977\">\n\t\t<div class=\"section-bg fill\" >\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\n\t\t<\/div>\n\n\t\t\n\n\t\t<div class=\"section-content relative\">\n\t\t\t\n<div class=\"row\"  id=\"row-888469301\">\n\n\t<div id=\"col-1125651360\" class=\"col small-12 large-12\"  >\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"col-inner\"  >\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t<div id=\"text-450454777\" class=\"text\">\n\t\t\n<h2>SO HOW DOES THE KIIERR LASER CAP WORK?<\/h2>\n<p>It is no surprise that the hair growth industry adopted this treatment practice after numerous clinical studies like this one resulted in new hair regrowth. Below you\u2019ll learn how this technology works to regrow hair on the scalp.<\/p>\n\t\t\n<style>\n#text-450454777 {\n  color: rgb(0,0,0);\n}\n#text-450454777 > * {\n  color: rgb(0,0,0);\n}\n<\/style>\n\t<\/div>\n\t\n<div class=\"row\"  id=\"row-310447748\">\n\n\t<div id=\"col-1767093961\" class=\"col medium-7 small-12 large-7\"  >\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"col-inner\"  >\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t<div id=\"text-559746116\" class=\"text\">\n\t\t\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Stimulates Skin Tissue-<\/strong> The lasers emit low light therapy to the skin\u2019s tissue on the scalp. As a result, blood flow is stimulated to the scalp tissue to reduce inflammation and begins to circulate throughout the head. Blood flow circulation transports the essential oxygen and nutrients to the hair follicles and results in cell regeneration in the problematic (thinning) areas of the hair.<\/li>\n<li>C<strong>ell Absorption and Protein Synthesis-<\/strong> When the light energy penetrates the skin, the weakened cells on the scalp absorb the light. This rejuvenates the scalp and allows for new hair to grow.<\/li>\n<li><strong>Regenerates Hair Follicle Cells-<\/strong> When the hair follicle cells are regenerated, the hair is \u201cbrought back to life\u201d from the dormant (telogen) stage of the hair growth cycle into the healthy growth (anagen) phase.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p>To put this technology in perspective, think of photosynthesis and the life of a plant. A plant needs healthy soil, proper nutrients, and sunlight to grow. Similarly, your hair needs a healthy scalp and proper nutrients to grow. Laser light therapy penetrates the skin tissue and stimulates blood flow. This allows the scalp to receive the proper nutrients and oxygen from this flowing blood. The weakened and dead hair follicle cells are absorbed through the light energy, and new hair follicles begin to grow. Read more about do laser caps work?<\/p>\n\t\t\n<style>\n#text-559746116 {\n  color: rgb(0,0,0);\n}\n#text-559746116 > * {\n  color: rgb(0,0,0);\n}\n<\/style>\n\t<\/div>\n\t\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\n\t\n\n\t<div id=\"col-961221177\" class=\"col medium-5 small-12 large-5\"  >\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"col-inner\"  >\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t<div class=\"img has-hover x md-x lg-x y md-y lg-y\" id=\"image_290580078\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"img-inner dark\" >\n\t\t\t<img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1200\" height=\"900\" src=\"https:\/\/kiierr.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/01\/Untitled-design-13-1.png\" class=\"attachment-original size-original\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https:\/\/kiierr.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/01\/Untitled-design-13-1.png 1200w, https:\/\/kiierr.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/01\/Untitled-design-13-1-800x600.png 800w, https:\/\/kiierr.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/01\/Untitled-design-13-1-300x225.png 300w, https:\/\/kiierr.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/01\/Untitled-design-13-1-1024x768.png 1024w, https:\/\/kiierr.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/01\/Untitled-design-13-1-768x576.png 768w, https:\/\/kiierr.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/01\/Untitled-design-13-1-510x382.png 510w, https:\/\/kiierr.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/01\/Untitled-design-13-1-1080x810.png 1080w, https:\/\/kiierr.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/01\/Untitled-design-13-1-980x735.png 980w, https:\/\/kiierr.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/01\/Untitled-design-13-1-480x360.png 480w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px\" \/>\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n<style>\n#image_290580078 {\n  width: 81%;\n}\n<\/style>\n\t<\/div>\n\t\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\n\t\n<\/div>\n\t<div id=\"text-2784748275\" class=\"text\">\n\t\t\n<p><strong>Advantages of the Kiierr Laser Cap<\/strong><\/p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Use for only 30 minutes every other day<\/strong><\/li>\n<li><strong>Comes with a standard two year warranty &amp; can be upgraded to 5 years<\/strong><\/li>\n<li><strong>7 month growth guarantee; see improved hair growth or your money back*<\/strong><\/li>\n<li><strong>Built in, automatic shut off timer<\/strong><\/li>\n<li><strong>Can be used in conjunction with other treatments such as Minoxidil, Kiierr hair serums, and Kiierr hair growth supplements.<\/strong><br \/>*One thing to note, results are not always immediate, and do not happen overnight. It is crucial to stay patient and consistently use your laser cap device every other day for the full seven months. However, keep in mind that customers can report noticeable hair growth in as little as 4-months based on testimonials like these.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\t\t\n<style>\n#text-2784748275 {\n  color: rgb(0,0,0);\n}\n#text-2784748275 > * {\n  color: rgb(0,0,0);\n}\n<\/style>\n\t<\/div>\n\t\n<a href=\"\/product\/kiierr-laser-hair-growth-products\/\" class=\"button primary\"  style=\"border-radius:99px;\">\n\t\t<span>TRY TODAY RISK FREE!<\/span>\n\t<\/a>\n\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\n\t\n<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\n\t\t\n<style>\n#section_667410977 {\n  padding-top: 60px;\n  padding-bottom: 60px;\n  background-color: rgb(246, 247, 249);\n}\n<\/style>\n\t<\/section>\n\t\n<div class=\"row\"  id=\"row-1935408000\">\n\n\t<div id=\"col-848788422\" class=\"col medium-6 small-12 large-6\"  >\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"col-inner\"  >\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t<div class=\"img has-hover x md-x lg-x y md-y lg-y\" id=\"image_60993152\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"img-inner dark\" >\n\t\t\t<img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"584\" height=\"278\" src=\"https:\/\/kiierr.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2018\/09\/Screen-Shot-2018-09-25-at-8.42.36-AM.png\" class=\"attachment-original size-original\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https:\/\/kiierr.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2018\/09\/Screen-Shot-2018-09-25-at-8.42.36-AM.png 584w, https:\/\/kiierr.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2018\/09\/Screen-Shot-2018-09-25-at-8.42.36-AM-247x118.png 247w, https:\/\/kiierr.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2018\/09\/Screen-Shot-2018-09-25-at-8.42.36-AM-510x243.png 510w, https:\/\/kiierr.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2018\/09\/Screen-Shot-2018-09-25-at-8.42.36-AM-300x143.png 300w, https:\/\/kiierr.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2018\/09\/Screen-Shot-2018-09-25-at-8.42.36-AM-480x228.png 480w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 584px) 100vw, 584px\" \/>\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n<style>\n#image_60993152 {\n  width: 100%;\n}\n<\/style>\n\t<\/div>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"img has-hover x md-x lg-x y md-y lg-y\" id=\"image_1863735009\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"img-inner dark\" >\n\t\t\t<img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"660\" height=\"270\" src=\"https:\/\/kiierr.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2018\/09\/Screen-Shot-2018-09-25-at-8.42.13-AM.png\" class=\"attachment-original size-original\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https:\/\/kiierr.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2018\/09\/Screen-Shot-2018-09-25-at-8.42.13-AM.png 660w, https:\/\/kiierr.com\/wp-content\/uploads\