49\">\n\t\t<div class=\"section-bg fill\" >\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\n\t\t<\/div>\n\n\t\t\n\n\t\t<div class=\"section-content relative\">\n\t\t\t\n<div class=\"row\"  id=\"row-1512895854\">\n\n\t<div id=\"col-510398612\" class=\"col medium-6 small-12 large-6\"  >\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"col-inner\"  >\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t<div id=\"text-1691015353\" class=\"text\">\n\t\t\n<h2>CLINICALLY PROVEN TO SAFELY GROW HAIR IN JUST 30 MINUTES PER DAY!<\/h2>\n<p>Kiierr Laser Hair Caps use scientifically proven LLLT technology to regenerate your hair follicles giving them increased energy &amp; blood flow. In just 30 minutes every other day (statement based on these 2 studies; 1, 2) you\u2019ll see those frail follicles transform into thick &amp; healthy hair once again!<\/p>\n<h3>How To Use:<\/h3>\n<p>Place the device comfortably on your head and push the on button to begin your session. The device will automatically turn off when finished. Learn more about how to use the Kiierr laser cap.<\/p>\n\t\t\n<style>\n#text-1691015353 {\n  color: rgb(0,0,0);\n}\n#text-1691015353 > * {\n  color: rgb(0,0,0);\n}\n<\/style>\n\t<\/div>\n\t\n<a href=\"\/product\/kiierr-laser-hair-growth-products\/\" class=\"button primary\"  style=\"border-radius:99px;\">\n\t\t<span>View Products<\/span>\n\t<\/a>\n\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\n\t\n\n\t<div id=\"col-2119244989\" class=\"col medium-6 small-12 large-6\"  >\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"col-inner\"  >\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t<div class=\"img has-hover x md-x lg-x y md-y lg-y\" id=\"image_1460644635\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"img-inner dark\" >\n\t\t\t<img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"571\" height=\"470\" src=\"https:\/\/kiierr.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2018\/09\/Innerpage-4_03_burned.png\" class=\"attachment-original size-original\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https:\/\/kiierr.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2018\/09\/Innerpage-4_03_burned.png 571w, https:\/\/kiierr.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2018\/09\/Innerpage-4_03_burned-247x203.png 247w, https